# Postfix `ᵀ` and `transpose(x)`: shapes swap, tags follow preserved_by_transpose.
A: Matrix[3, 4] kg
S: Symmetric Matrix[3, 3]
P: PositiveDefinite Matrix[3, 3]
Q: Orthogonal Matrix[3, 3]
D: Diagonal Matrix[3, 3]
At = Aᵀ
